      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Core Cognition\n\n- **Executive / Planner**: chooses goals and decomposes tasks\n- **Reasoner**: evaluates options and consequences\n- **World Model**: maintains current reality\n- **Memory Manager**: preserves experience, facts, and skills\n\nThis layer decides what the android believes, remembers, and intends.",
