        "markdown": "# Perception\n\n- **Vision Agent**: objects, faces, motion, spatial layout\n- **Audio Agent**: speech, sound localization, alerts\n- **Touch / Proprioception**: pressure, balance, joint state\n- **Sensor Fusion**: combines signals into one scene\n\nThis layer turns raw sensation into usable reality.",
