        "markdown": "# Action and Body\n\n- **Task Executor**: turns plans into steps\n- **Motion Planner**: creates safe paths and gestures\n- **Motor Controller**: drives joints, hands, balance, grip\n- **Tool Use Agent**: handles objects and devices\n\nThis layer converts intention into physical behavior.",
