        "markdown": "# Safety and Stewardship\n\n- **Safety Monitor**: prevents collisions and unsafe motion\n- **Policy Guard**: blocks forbidden actions\n- **Health Monitor**: battery, heat, wear, damage\n- **Calibration Agent**: keeps sensors and actuators aligned\n\nThis layer keeps the android alive, lawful, and trustworthy.",
