      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Communication\n\n- **Language Understanding**: interprets requests and context\n- **Dialogue Manager**: maintains conversation state\n- **Language Generation**: speaks clearly and appropriately\n- **Social Signal Agent**: tone, timing, expression, gaze\n\nThis layer lets the android be understood as a social being.",
