      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Orchestration Layer\n\nThe orchestrator routes work between agents, manages priority, and keeps shared state coherent.\n\nIt answers:\n\n- Who owns this decision?\n- Which agent has authority?\n- What is true right now?\n- What should happen next?\n\nWithout orchestration, the android becomes a committee with legs.",
